                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Potin Lai",
                        "email": "potin.lai@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "potinlai"
                    },
                    "message": "Catalina has 4 leak cables.\nI updated the name to represent the place of leak cable detecting."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/catalina_pdb_hsc_ltc_fsc_max_vr_delta_gndsen_ina_p12vsen_ina_p12vfan_mps.json",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks.\n\nI think those \"cables\" are internal though?  Generally we want \"LeakCable\" to be used for the external connector ports on the RMC to avoid confusion."
                }
            ],
